# 跨平台协作的基本约定：换行与二进制标记
#
# 不设 * text=auto 的裸写法，而是明确按文本处理源码，避免 Windows 检出 CRLF 后
# 整个仓库的 diff 全部变成「改了一行、实际改的是行尾」。

* text=auto eol=lf

*.js text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要让 git 尝试按文本 diff 或转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 归档与截图：不做行尾处理
*.snap binary
